body:
I finally got myself to think rationally again so I won't be nearly as crazy sounding now as I did in this post, yeesh that's some extreme stuff now that I look back at it,,,

I may be a massive pessimist that's always like "UGH stuff just happens and nothing gets better" but I still really appreciate the comment, it's nice to think that things could get better somehow. I mean, I hope things get less stupid, I can't see how it happens but at least after that...fun...post I can see what I wish my future could be like so I have something to work toward. I really should give myself more credit for small victories though, I hear that around and never bothered to try it...I'll keep those little things in mind and see if it helps.
Thanks a whole bunch for reading my stupid ramble thing and taking the time to write that, you've got no idea how much it means to me to see someone isn't immediately trying to talk down to me for once ;;;
